      "filename": "Bull sculpture by Isidore Bonheur in Istanbul,Türkiye.jpg",
      "title": "File:Bull sculpture by Isidore Bonheur in Istanbul,Türkiye.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/Bull_sculpture_by_Isidore_Bonheur_in_Istanbul%2CT%C3%BCrkiye.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bull_sculpture_by_Isidore_Bonheur_in_Istanbul,T%C3%BCrkiye.jpg",
      "width": 990,
